            <fieldText>&lt;b&gt;CHECK CNAM LOOKUP&lt;/b&gt;

Check the Calling Number CNAM information using the CNAM Lookup Tool to see if the calling number has the correct CNAM information.

&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-left: 40px;list-style-type:square;&amp;nbsp;&quot;&gt; 
&lt;li&gt;Go to Admin Interface &gt; Click Phone DB on the left-side 
&lt;li&gt;Click &lt;b&gt;CNAM/TeleSign Lookup&lt;/b&gt;

&lt;img src=&apos;/resource/inbound_cname_image2&apos; /&gt; 

&lt;li&gt;Enter the Calling Number that is in question and click Lookup

&lt;img src=&apos;/resource/inbound_cname_image3&apos; /&gt;

&lt;li&gt;It will provide its CNAM information associated with the number in question, and tells you the location where the phone number is registered

&lt;img src=&apos;/resource/inbound_cname_image4&apos; /&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Note:&lt;/b&gt; In the event that you encounter a road block when using this guide, please ask assistance from a Team Lead.
&lt;p&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
