        <fields>
            <name>Tile1</name>
            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inbound Caller ID Name&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
The caller ID service may include the transmission of name associated with the calling telephone number called CNAM. 
Inbound CNAM displays a caller&apos;s phone number or caller&apos;s name on the recipient&apos;s phone device before the call is answered.

&lt;b&gt;SYMPTOM/s:&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-left: 40px;list-style-type:disc;&amp;nbsp;&quot;&gt; 
&lt;li&gt;Incoming calls showing incorrect caller information
&lt;li&gt;No name showing up
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;b&gt;REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-left: 40px;list-style-type:disc;&amp;nbsp;&quot;&gt; 
&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;User/Extension Status&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-left: 40px;list-style-type:circle;&amp;nbsp;&quot;&gt; 
&lt;li&gt;Must be “Enabled”.
&lt;li&gt;Extensions on “Not Activated” state should be set to “Enabled”
&lt;/ul&gt;
